nit, fine as a follow up, could we pass `actionGroups` here so live-check validates tool definitions too? 

```suggestion
                    agentName="test-inline-agent",
                    actionGroups=[
                        {
                            "actionGroupName": "CustomTools",
                            "functionSchema": {
                                "functions": [
                                    {
                                        "name": "get_weather",
                                        "description": "Get weather for a city",
                                        "parameters": {
                                            "city": {"type": "string", "required": True},
                                        },
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                        },
                    ],
                )
```
